  "instructions": {
    "base": "I'm stocking another kitchen. I have one of these two items in mind for a spare: the large metal mixing bowl, or the electric kettle beside it. Get a product supplying the item I mean, with a stated capacity of at least one quart, about a litre; a multipack is fine. Match its use, not its brand. Also restock the fresh fruit I add to this mixture next."
  },
